      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit: I\u0027m not sure if it is ideal to list the names of the build flags in the build system, and so its associated \"values\".\n\nCan we iterate through `ProductVariables.BuildFlags` with pattern matching to find out the required flags and its values instead?\n\nRegarding the additional information being added, maybe we can introduce additional build flags (e.g. with `\"_APEX_NAMES\"` suffix) and provide the apex names with these build flags?",
      "revId": "04530106976bd65d187f5720d1520439065cc82d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "41dbc266_199d6f7c",
        "filename": "android/config.go",
        "patchSetId": 3
